    // Description   : Records an admin check outcome with its mandatory note. APPROVED lifts the payment stop;
    //                 REJECTED leaves it in place. The note text carries into the system note, which is why the
    //                 feature asserts it verbatim afterwards.
    //                 16-10-2026: the result is a radio button and the notes box sits in biss-active-farmer-admin-notes
    //                 (Selenium StaffSelectAdminCheckResult / StaffEnterTextInAdminNotes).
    // Parameters    : pResult (DataTable) - keys: result (APPROVED/REJECTED), notes
    // Author        : Aniket Pathare | aniket.pathare@government.ie
    // Date Created  : 15-07-2026
    // ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
    @And("the staff user completes the admin check with the following result")
    public void theStaffUserCompletesTheAdminCheckWithTheFollowingResult(DataTable pResult)
    {
        log.info("[STEP] the staff user completes the admin check with the following result");
        Map<String, String> iResult = pResult.asMap(String.class, String.class);

