    // ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
    // Function Name : theStaffUserCancelsAForceMajeureRequestAcrossTheFollowingYears
    // Description   : Opens the Force Majeure dialog and cancels it, for each scheme year in the table, on ONE
    //                 herd. Force Majeure rules differ by year, hence the sweep. Cancelling must leave the
    //                 application untouched - the escape path before a consequential change is committed.
    //                 No herd in play yet: the first submitted herd of the FIRST year in the table is used.
    // Parameters    : pYears (DataTable) - single column of scheme years
    // Author        : Aniket Pathare | aniket.pathare@government.ie
    // Date Created  : 15-07-2026 | Updated: 05-10-2026 (Playwright)
