    // Description   : Each named row is present under Reduction Type, as plain or bold text (the four Selenium variants
    //                 StaffCheckReductionTypeHeadings 1-4 in one locator). The BISS, CRISS and CISYF amounts of each row are
    //                 logged, as Selenium printed them. A missing row fails the step, listing every missing row.
    // Parameters    : pRows (DataTable) - single column of row names; the text only has to be contained, e.g. Between
    // Author        : Aniket Pathare | aniket.pathare@government.ie
    // Date Created  : 16-10-2026
